476:       <div class="sheet-grip" aria-hidden="true"></div>
477:       <h3 id="help-title">How AdPlay works</h3>
478:       <p>Seven playable ads, recreated as real mini-games. No install. No purchases. One suspiciously honest skip button.</p>
479:       <ul>
480:         <li><span class="sheet-num">1</span><span><b>Every level is the ad.</b> Runner hordes, survivor swarms, bullet hell, knife timing, snake growth, potion sorting and one very good dog.</span></li>
481:         <li><span class="sheet-num">2</span><span><b>Beat the objective</b> to earn up to three stars. Your best scores stay on this device.</span></li>
482:         <li><span class="sheet-num">3</span><span><b>Skip if you must.</b> The countdown is real. The judgement is also real.</span></li>
483:         <li><span class="sheet-num">4</span><span><b>All sprites are original recreations</b> of the ad-iverse, drawn for this game. No actual ads were harmed.</span></li>
484:       </ul>
485:       <button class="sheet-close" type="button">GOT IT, SHOW ME THE ADS</button>
486:     </div>
487:   `;
488:   document.getElementById("app").appendChild(layer);
489:   const close = () => layer.remove();
490:   layer.addEventListener("click", (e) => { if (e.target === layer) close(); });
491:   layer.querySelector(".sheet-close").addEventListener("click", () => { audio.tap(); close(); });
492:   audio.tap();
