527:       "You're already playing it. That's the install.",
528:       "Install button is decorative. Like the ad's gameplay.",
529:       "Nice try. The only download is emotional.",
530:       "This button has never worked. It's part of the brand.",
531:     ];
532:     showToast(messages[Math.floor(Math.random() * messages.length)], 2200);
